{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105954","id":2491835449,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UhmQ5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105954","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105954.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105954.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105954","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105954/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105954/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105954/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3fce22d95ac92fc85935b14ba905c93e969084c9","number":105954,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Return the length of the longest stream in AudioStreamRandomizer","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105929\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104684\r\n\r\nCurrently, **AudioStreamRandomizer**'s `get_length()`returns `0.0`, meaning the engine essentially thinks the length cannot be obtained. This is somewhat silly in hindsight.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes it so that the longest... length out of the available streams in the **AudioStreamRandomizer** is chosen, thus allowing **AudioStreamInteractive** to work with it, as well.\r\nFrom there, it is up to the developer to ensure all random streams are roughly the same length, in order to avoid awkward silence.\r\n\r\nAs of writing this has not been tested just yet. It may need to be documented as well.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-30T15:34:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T15:30:53Z","closed_at":"2025-06-10T17:39:08Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"99385e0019ea42c770eab06a70b1d33ffecb7ed0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Mickeon:AudioStreamRandomizer-has-length","ref":"AudioStreamRandomizer-has-length","repo":{"id":435895180,"node_id":"R_kgDOGfs7jA","name":"godot","full_name":"Mickeon/godot","owner":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","ur